60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Looking at the options, I must advise against A due to weather delays and C because of the hazardous materials in ground-floor partitions. B seems the safest and most helpful for many.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with Shizue! B provides a booking system for everyone, which solves the problem of people being turned away from rooms, and it doesn't seem as risky as the others!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,I must disagree. Option D is the only one that addresses the critical failure of our equipment and the resulting burden on our technicians. We cannot prioritize convenience over essential operational support.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, while D is necessary, it is a mechanical project with rising costs and benefits a single wing, which my data shows leads to low satisfaction. B offers campus-wide utility and avoids the delivery risks of A and C.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@George, your dedication to the staff is admirable, but D is a financial minefield given the rising cost of mechanical plant. B avoids those risks and addresses the AV reserve void I discovered. I vote for B.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Benjamin and Mizuki. Option B avoids the risks of weather and hazardous materials while serving the whole community. It is the most prudent and kind choice for everyone. I vote for B.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm with everyone! Option B gives us those much-needed rooms that people can actually book, and it doesn't sound like it will cause the huge delays or costs we're worried about. I vote for B!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"I cannot in good conscience support a plan that ignores the daily struggle of our technicians. While B is convenient, D is a necessity for those keeping this university running. I vote for D.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, I respect your position, but we must prioritize a project that is likely to succeed and benefit the most people. Option B is the most logical choice. I vote for B.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"The consensus is quite clear. While George's concerns are valid, the data regarding mechanical costs and delivery risks makes Option D a gamble we cannot afford. Option B is the most rational path. I maintain my vote for B.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I believe we have reached a thoughtful consensus. While we all care for our staff, the risks associated with the other options are simply too high. I am happy to stand by my vote for B.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm happy we could find a solution that helps so many students and staff! It feels like the best way to make everyone's campus life better. I'm sticking with my vote for B!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"I see that I am in the minority here. While I remain convinced that the technicians' burden is a critical issue, I cannot force a decision against such a strong consensus. I maintain my vote for D.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"It is clear that we have weighed the operational needs against the strategic risks. While the technicians' situation is regrettable, Option B is the only choice that aligns with all our data. I vote for B.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a rare pleasure when logic and consensus align so seamlessly. We have navigated the risks of weather, hazardous materials, and fiscal volatility to find a sustainable path. I vote for B.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
